Description: VPinOS cabinet customizations
 The parts of VPinOS that make a Debian system a pinball cabinet: the
 console menu (vpinos-menu), the Hyprland kiosk launcher (vpinos-launch),
 the cabinet configuration tool (vpinos-config), their root helpers,
 sudoers rules, systemd units and login hooks.
 .
 Also carries the default cabinet configuration (Hyprland configs, boot
 mode, GPU driver choice, vpinfe settings and theme). Those are copied
 into place once, on first install, and never modified by an upgrade.
 .
 Only installs on a system built from a VPinOS 1.1 or newer image.
